    "attributes": {
        "action": "Apply to adopt the Euro currency",
        "additional_details": "This is possible to do without being a member of the EU. Kosovo and Montenegro have already done it.",
        "background": "We are regular everyday citizens who see that the UK is working towards refreshing the relationship with our closest trading partner which is the EU. We might be British but we feel aligned with Europe and would like to see the Euro being adopted here.",
